INTERVIEW TRAP QUESTIONS
======================================================================

Q1. Does Continuous Deployment require manual approval?

Answer

No.

Every successful build is automatically deployed to production.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q2. Can Continuous Deployment work without automated testing?

Answer

No.

Continuous Deployment depends heavily on reliable automated testing.
Without it, defective code may reach production.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q3. Is Continuous Deployment suitable for every application?

Answer

No.

It is generally not suitable for safety-critical or highly regulated
applications where manual approval is mandatory.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q4. What happens if automated tests miss a bug?

Answer

The faulty code may be automatically deployed to production and become
available to end users.

